            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Rubbish? (ਕੂੜਾ, kūṛā.) A basket? (ਟੋਕਰੀ, ṭokrī.) A box? (ਡੱਬਾ, ḍabbā.) A clay water pot? (ਘੜਾ, ghaṛā.) A candle? (ਮੋਮਬੱਤੀ, mombattī.) Matches? (ਮਾਚਿਸ, mācis.) A carpet? (ਗਲੀਚਾ, galīcā.) A pillow? (ਸਿਰਹਾਣਾ, sirhāṇā.) A doll? (ਗੁੱਡੀ, guḍḍī.) A toy? (ਖਿਡੌਣਾ, khiḍauṇā.) A cot? (ਮੰਜਾ, mañjā.) Pyjamas? (ਪਜਾਮਾ, pajāmā.) A salwar? (ਸਲਵਾਰ, salvār.) A scarf? (ਚੁੰਨੀ, cunnī.) A belt? (ਪੇਟੀ, peṭī.) A handkerchief? (ਰੁਮਾਲ, rumāl.) A sweater? (ਸਵੈਟਰ, savaiṭar.) A coat? (ਕੋਟ, koṭ.) A ring? (ਅੰਗੂਠੀ, angūṭhī.) A bangle? (ਕੰਗਣ, kangaṇ.)"
            }
          ]
        }
